  "notes": [
    "Versions come from the fixed 3.7.1 images; REST reports the full artifact version 3.5.0.69fa31 at runtime, while the distro manifest says 3.5.0. Smoke tests check the exact runtime versions.",
    "PostgreSQL uses a pinned official 16.15 image with dedicated PostgreSQL and application volumes; compatibility is checked by fresh startup, module, API and persistence tests.",
    "Backend is derived from the fixed 3.7.1 release: large demo content and its generator are removed, base reference metadata is kept, and one synthetic login/facility/visit location is loaded with Initializer.",
    "Upstream moving no-demo tags were not used because inspection showed snapshot components. Vietnamese clinical metadata is not implemented yet.",
    "The pinned backend includes checked-in PostgreSQL patches for Appointments Liquibase and TEXT/BYTEA Hibernate binding; see infra/backend/postgresql/README.md. Upstream component version numbers remain unchanged."
  ],
